---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research
description: "Plain-language explainers for each of Eugene Koh's publications on plant stress, singlet oxygen and plant-kingdom transcriptomics."
---
{% from "partials/scenes.njk" import scene %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% from "partials/cards.njk" import pubCard %}

<div class="hero-scene hero-scene--page hero-scene--short">
  {{ scene("evolution", "research", label="A dotted trail running from a pond of algae past mosses, ferns and conifers to a flowering tree") }}
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head card">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-icon">{{ icon("book", 18) }}</span> Research</p>
    <h1>Publications, explained</h1>
    <p class="lede">Each paper has its own page telling its story in plain language: the question, what we did, what we found and why it matters. Choose a thread, or browse them all.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by research thread">
    <button class="chip is-active" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
    {% for t in threads %}
    <button class="chip t-{{ t.key }}" type="button" data-filter="{{ t.key }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ icon(t.icon, 16) }} {{ t.short }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% for t in threads %}
  <p class="thread-blurb t-{{ t.key }}" data-blurb="{{ t.key }}" hidden>{{ t.blurb }}</p>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="pub-years">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden">Publications, newest first</h2>
    <div class="pub-grid">
      {% for p in collections.publications %}{{ pubCard(p) }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="other-pubs" aria-labelledby="other-h">
    <h2 id="other-h">Other collaborations</h2>
    <p>Beyond plant biology, I've contributed to collaborative studies in neuroscience, integrative medicine and bacterial genetics.</p>
    <ul class="other-list">
      {% for o in otherPublications %}
      <li>
        <span class="other-year">{{ o.year }}</span>
        <div>
          <a href="https://doi.org/{{ o.doi }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ o.title }}</a>
          <p class="other-meta"><em>{{ o.journal }}</em> · {{ o.authors | highlightMe | safe }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>
